* AD4021 20-bit SAR ADC front end digitising a 1 V DC input

* Primary analog input
VIN IN 0 DC 1

* Differential input driver, VCM = 2.5 V
BPLUS DRV_P 0 V={2.5+0.5*V(IN)}
BMINUS DRV_N 0 V={2.5-0.5*V(IN)}
RINP DRV_P ADC_P 20
RINN DRV_N ADC_N 20
CINP ADC_P 0 1n
CINN ADC_N 0 1n
CDIFF ADC_P ADC_N 2.7n

* AD4021 core and interface supplies
VVDD VDD_RAW 0 DC 1.8
RVDD VDD_RAW VDD 1
CVDD1 VDD 0 100n
CVDD2 VDD 0 10u

VVIO VIO_RAW 0 DC 1.8
RVIO VIO_RAW VIO 1
CVIO1 VIO 0 100n
CVIO2 VIO 0 1u

* Low-noise 5 V reference and decoupling
VREFSRC REF_RAW 0 DC 5
RREF REF_RAW REF 0.2
CREF1 REF 0 100n
CREF2 REF 0 10u

* Conversion-start clock: 500 kSPS, 1 us conversion interval
VCNV CNV 0 PULSE(0 1.8 500n 1n 1n 1u 2u)

* Serial conversion clock, enabled only while CNV is high
VCLKRAW CLK_RAW 0 PULSE(0 1.8 0 1n 1n 24n 50n)
BSCK SCK 0 V={IF(V(CNV)>0.9,V(CLK_RAW),0)}

* Functional AD4021 instance
* OUT is the sampled, 20-bit quantized differential result in volts
XADC ADC_P ADC_N REF VDD VIO CNV SCK OUT 0 AD4021_FUNCTIONAL

* Representative digital output loading
COUT OUT 0 10p
ROUTLOAD OUT 0 1Meg

.tran 0 5u 0 1n
.meas TRAN OUT_SETTLED AVG V(OUT) FROM 3.5u TO 4.4u
.options plotwinsize=0

.subckt AD4021_FUNCTIONAL INP INN REF VDD VIO CNV SCK OUT GND

* Differential input presented to the internal sample-and-hold
EDIFF DIFF GND VALUE={V(INP,INN)}

* Track while CNV is low and hold during conversion
BTRACK TRACK_CTL GND V={V(VDD,GND)-V(CNV,GND)}
SSAMPLE DIFF SAMPLE TRACK_CTL GND SADC
CSAMPLE SAMPLE GND 20p
RSAMPLE SAMPLE GND 1T
.model SADC SW(Ron=5 Roff=1T Vt=0.9 Vh=0.05)

* 20-bit bipolar quantizer: input range is -REF to +REF
BQUANT CODE GND V={IF((V(VDD,GND)>1.5)&&(V(VIO,GND)>1.5),LIMIT(FLOOR(V(SAMPLE,GND)/V(REF,GND)*524288+0.5)/524288*V(REF,GND),-V(REF,GND),V(REF,GND)),0)}
ROUTCODE CODE OUT 50

* Interface input loading
RCNV CNV GND 100Meg
RSCK SCK GND 100Meg
CCNV CNV GND 2p
CSCK SCK GND 2p

.ends AD4021_FUNCTIONAL

.end
